## Execution summary — A2_fx_carry, round r6 (overnight/intraday split)

**Setup:** Built the ON/ID decomposition for the full 298-panel (5005 tradable nights, 2006-09→2026-08), verified (1+on_t)(1+id_{t+1})−1 = close-to-close exactly, winsorized 4 legit corporate-action gaps (AIG/GM 2009, SOFI 2021), charged the charter-mandated 12bp/day round trip.

**Ideas (all gates run; nothing passed even gate a):**

| # | idea | result | verdict |
|---|------|--------|---------|
